Third-party dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

engine/ (Java, see engine/pom.xml):
  Eclipse RDF4J          BSD-3-Clause / Eclipse Distribution License 1.0
  SLF4J                  MIT License
  JUnit 4 (tests only)   Eclipse Public License 1.0

reference/ (Python):
  PySDD (optional)       Apache-2.0     — SDD compilation
  RDFLib                 BSD-3-Clause   — independent SPARQL oracle (required by
                                          quick_verify.py's composition differential)
  tqdm (optional)        MPL-2.0 / MIT  — progress reporting in extended experiments
  The core reference, ROBDD/WMC and CLI use the standard library only.

Benchmarks reference, but do not bundle, any dataset. The repository ships only
small worked examples (the drug running example, the paper example under both
reification schemes, the query gallery, and four checked-in circuits). The
following must be obtained separately, each under its own licence or terms of
use; README.md "Data Acquisition" states how each is prepared for the engine:

  WatDiv data generator   http://dsg.uwaterloo.ca/watdiv/
  TPC-H dbgen             https://www.tpc.org/tpch/         (subject to the TPC's terms)
  Wikidata dumps          https://dumps.wikimedia.org/wikidatawiki/entities/
  WDBench graph           https://github.com/MillenniumDB/WDBench
  GraphDB triplestore     https://graphdb.ontotext.com/
